full_judgment:
(a) to pass a decree for permanent injunction restraining the defendant from manufacturing, marketing, distributing, selling, displaying or in any way dealing with the products bearing the imitated brand name or trade mark "Fair & Care" more specifically shown at Schedule "B"; 

 (b) to pass a decree ordering the destruction of the impugned label with the brand name "Fair & Care" and removal of sign boards and bill boards containing the imitating label with the expression "Fair & Care"; 

 (d) to pass a decree for all costs of the suit against the defendant and in favour of the plaintiff; 

 (e) to pass a decree for any other relief or relieves that the plaintiff is entitled to in law and in equity.
